---
description: WordPress and WooCommerce plugin rules
globs: ["**/*.php"]
---

This project is a custom WordPress / WooCommerce plugin for trefik.nl.

Rules:

- Only modify files inside this plugin
- Never modify WordPress core, WooCommerce core, themes, or other plugins

- Follow PSR-4 (namespaces)
- Follow PSR-12 (formatting)

- Respect the autoloader in ./src/Autoloader.php
- All classes must be loaded from ./includes

- Prefer hooks, filters, and WooCommerce extension points over overrides

- Always:
  - Sanitize input
  - Escape output
  - Use nonces where needed
  - Check capabilities

- Keep changes minimal and targeted
- Do not refactor large parts unless explicitly requested

- Be careful with:
  - Checkout flow
  - Cart logic
  - Orders
  - Product data

- Maintain compatibility with existing plugin behavior